// pickup wearing a different tag (a solid shape, a tag check, a value that
// changes), and the student can source all three. What they have never done is
// let the physics engine do the moving: while `transform.Translate` edits
// coordinates directly, a solid spike is only a picture, and that part is left
// as the gap — with its reading still attached, because finding the answer is
// the skill being practised, not guessing it.
