      does: '`OnCollisionEnter2D` fires when solid colliders meet, and its parameter is a `Collision2D` — a container, not a collider — which is why the tag is asked of `collision.gameObject` rather than of `collision` itself. Same tag check as the coin, one level of indirection further out.',
      doc: 'the `OnCollisionEnter2D(Collision2D c)` and `other.CompareTag("Coin")` rows in the quick reference.',
      href: '../docs/reference/unity-csharp-quickref.html',
    },
